{"seq":2,"slug":"label-design-series-limit-control","title":"治理手段：标签设计、relabel drop 与 series limit","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/timeseries-database-prometheus-tsdb-storage-engine/cardinality-operate-scale/label-design-series-limit-control","wordCount":2289,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"治理手段-标签设计-relabel-drop-与-series-limit\">治理手段：标签设计、relabel drop 与 series limit</h1><p>一个中型的电商监控集群，<code>prometheus_tsdb_head_series</code> 从 80 万涨到 420 万只用了三周——没人改采集配置，但 Kubernetes 滚动发布让每个 Pod 的 UID 都进了一个标签。这类事故的根因从来不是&quot;Prometheus 存不下&quot;，而是<strong>标签把不可枚举的值当成了维度</strong>。本文讨论高基数问题的下游处置，按治理成本从低到高分三层：标签设计这个最上游关口、抓取路径上的 <code>relabel</code> 过滤、以及 <code>series limit</code> 强制封顶。上游&quot;基数从哪来、怎么量&quot;见同章节的 <a href=\"cardinality-source-measurement\">高基数来源与度量</a>；样本与标签的语义基础见 <a href=\"../tsdb-model-ingestion/metric-label-sample-model\">指标、标签与样本模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先钉住四个词。<strong>基数（cardinality）<strong>是同一指标下</strong>唯一标签组合的个数</strong>。若一个指标有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个标签，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个标签有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|V_i|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 个不同取值，理论上界是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\prod_{i=1}^{n} |V_i|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>但上界几乎从不成立：<code>instance</code> 与 <code>pod</code> 高度相关，同时出现时并不翻倍。真正致命的是<strong>高基数标签</strong>——取值数随业务规模线性增长的标签（<code>pod</code>、<code>request_id</code>、<code>user_id</code>、<code>url_path</code>），它们使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 从常数域跃迁到线性域。**churn（序列更替）**指旧序列停止写入、新序列不断产生的速率；滚动发布一个 500 Pod 的 Deployment，就产生 500 条新序列 + 500 条进入 <code>stale</code> 的旧序列。**series limit（序列限额）**是人为设定的序列数上限，超过即拒绝写入或丢样本，是&quot;防止基数事故拖垮整个 TSDB&quot;的最后一道闸。<strong>relabel</strong> 是采集链路在样本落库前对标签做增删改的规则集，<code>drop</code>/<code>keep</code>/<code>hashmod</code> 是其中用于降基数的三个动作。</p>\n<p>治理的作用点分三层，越靠上游成本越低：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[标签设计&lt;br/&gt;应用侧决定打什么标签] --&gt; B[relabel 过滤&lt;br/&gt;抓取路径上删/留/散列]&#10;    B --&gt; C[series limit&lt;br/&gt;落库前的强制封顶]&#10;    C --&gt; D[TSDB 写入]&#10;    A -.上游,零成本,治本.-&gt; D&#10;    B -.中游,改配置即可.-&gt; D&#10;    C -.下游,已产生流量才拦.-&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n    A[标签设计&lt;br/&gt;应用侧决定打什么标签] --&gt; B[relabel 过滤&lt;br/&gt;抓取路径上删/留/散列]\n    B --&gt; C[series limit&lt;br/&gt;落库前的强制封顶]\n    C --&gt; D[TSDB 写入]\n    A -.上游,零成本,治本.-&gt; D\n    B -.中游,改配置即可.-&gt; D\n    C -.下游,已产生流量才拦.-&gt; D</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>治理层</th>\n<th>作用位置</th>\n<th>典型手段</th>\n<th>生效延迟</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标签设计</td>\n<td>应用/client 库</td>\n<td>维度建模、禁止不可枚举值</td>\n<td>需发版</td>\n<td>需业务改造</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>relabel</td>\n<td>scrape / remote_write 配置</td>\n<td><code>drop</code> <code>keep</code> <code>labeldrop</code> <code>hashmod</code></td>\n<td>热重载即生效</td>\n<td>可能丢有用维度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>series limit</td>\n<td>scrape / 租户 / 引擎</td>\n<td><code>sample_limit</code> <code>label_limit</code>、租户级限额</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>硬失败，可能丢监控</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"标签设计-把维度放进名字还是放进标签\">标签设计：把维度放进名字还是放进标签</h2><p>Prometheus 官方在 <a href=\"https://prometheus.io/docs/practices/instrumentation/\">Instrumentation practices</a> 里给出的判据只有一条：<strong>一个标签的取值集合必须是有限的、可以列举的</strong>，并且每个不同取值都应当在查询时有聚合意义。<code>status=&quot;500&quot;</code> 满足——HTTP 状态码可枚举；<code>user_id=&quot;a3f9...&quot;</code> 不满足——取值集合随用户数无界增长。</p>\n<p>一个常用于电商场景的反例是订单漏斗埋点。开发者把 <code>order_id</code> 打进标签，想&quot;精确到每单&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"checkout_attempts_total{order_id=&quot;ORD-8817293&quot;, step=&quot;payment&quot;, region=&quot;sg&quot;} 1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>checkout_attempts_total{order_id=\"ORD-8817293\", step=\"payment\", region=\"sg\"} 1</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>order_id</code> 的基数是订单总量，一个日 50 万单的业务每天新增 50 万序列，且它在查询时<strong>没有任何聚合意义</strong>——没人会 <code>sum by(order_id)</code>。正确处理是把它降为<strong>日志/事件</strong>（trace、日志系统才该承载无界标识），指标只保留可聚合的边界：<code>region</code>、<code>step</code>、<code>payment_method</code>。若确实需要按订单追踪，用 exemplars（<code>--storage.tsdb.max-exemplars</code> 控制）把 trace_id 挂到样本上，而不是把它变成标签。</p>\n<p>更隐蔽的一类是<strong>过度拆分的&quot;高精度&quot;标签</strong>。把 <code>url=&quot;/api/v1/orders/{id}/items&quot;</code> 与 <code>url=&quot;/api/v1/orders/{id}/refunds&quot;</code> 拆成两个标签值看似合理，但当 path 嵌入对象 ID 时，标签基数就等于 URL 基数。Kubernetes 场景下的 <code>pod</code> 同理：<code>pod</code> 名带随机后缀（<code>checkout-7d9f8c4b5-x2k9p</code>），每次滚动发布换一批，序列数随发布次数单调递增。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标签</th>\n<th>取值来源</th>\n<th>取值范围</th>\n<th>可作维度</th>\n<th>替代方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>job</code> / <code>env</code> / <code>region</code></td>\n<td>配置</td>\n<td>可枚举（&lt; 100）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>status_code</code></td>\n<td>应用</td>\n<td>可枚举（~50）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pod</code></td>\n<td>K8s 运行时</td>\n<td>随副本数+发布次数增长</td>\n<td>谨慎</td>\n<td>用 <code>workload</code>（Deployment 名）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>instance</code></td>\n<td>目标地址</td>\n<td>随主机数增长</td>\n<td>谨慎</td>\n<td>分片后按需保留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>user_id</code> / <code>order_id</code></td>\n<td>业务</td>\n<td>无界</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>日志 / exemplar</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>request_id</code> / <code>trace_id</code></td>\n<td>请求</td>\n<td>无界</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>exemplar</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"relabel-抓取路径上的-drop-keep-hashmod\">relabel：抓取路径上的 drop/keep/hashmod</h2><p>如果应用侧标签来不及改（第三方 exporter、SaaS 指标、多团队共享集群），就要在采集链路上把高基数维度<strong>删掉或分散掉</strong>。Prometheus 提供三个位置：<code>scrape_configs</code> 里的 <code>relabel_configs</code>（作用于 <strong>target 发现阶段</strong>，此时标签是 <code>__meta_*</code> 元数据）、<code>metric_relabel_configs</code>（作用于<strong>样本落库前</strong>，此时标签才是最终标签）、以及 <code>remote_write</code> 的 <code>write_relabel_configs</code>。三者的差别是<strong>作用时机</strong>：<code>relabel_configs</code> 决定&quot;采哪些 target&quot;，<code>metric_relabel_configs</code> 决定&quot;采到的样本里留哪些序列&quot;。</p>\n<p>删除无界标签最直接的是 <code>labeldrop</code>，它按正则删除匹配的标签名：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"scrape_configs:&#10;  - job_name: kubernetes-pods&#10;    metric_relabel_configs:&#10;      - regex: pod_uid&#10;        action: labeldrop&#10;      - regex: (container_id|image_id)&#10;        action: labeldrop&#10;      - source_labels: [__name__]&#10;        regex: &#39;go_(gc|memstats)_.+&#39;&#10;        action: drop\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">scrape_configs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">job_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kubernetes-pods</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    metric_relabel_configs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">regex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pod_uid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">labeldrop</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">regex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(container_id|image_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">labeldrop</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">source_labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">__name__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        regex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'go_(gc|memstats)_.+'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">drop</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>labeldrop</code> 删除的是<strong>整个标签维度</strong>，<code>drop</code> 删除的是<strong>整条序列</strong>（匹配即丢弃，不再写入）。二者不要混淆：想降基数用 <code>labeldrop</code>，想排除噪音指标（如 <code>go_gc_*</code> 这类进程级垃圾）用 <code>drop</code>。<code>keep</code> 是 <code>drop</code> 的补集，只保留匹配的序列，适合&quot;白名单&quot;式的严格收敛。</p>\n<p><code>hashmod</code> 是另一类手段——它<strong>不降低基数，而是把基数分散</strong>。多台 Prometheus 做水平分片时，用一致哈希把不同 target 分到不同实例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"relabel_configs:&#10;  - source_labels: [__address__]&#10;    modulus: 4&#10;    target_label: __tmp_shard&#10;    action: hashmod&#10;  - source_labels: [__tmp_shard]&#10;    regex: &#39;2&#39;&#10;    action: keep\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">relabel_configs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">source_labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">__address__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    modulus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    target_label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">__tmp_shard</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">hashmod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">source_labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">__tmp_shard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    regex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">keep</span></span></code></pre></div><p>上面的配置让该实例只保留 <code>hash(addr) % 4 == 2</code> 的 target，四台实例均分负载。<strong>hashmod 的前提是分片数固定</strong>——<code>modulus</code> 一变，全部 target 重新分配，会引发大规模 churn，因此分片扩容要按批、在低峰期做。</p>\n<p><code>labelmap</code> 用于把 <code>__meta_kubernetes_pod_label_*</code> 这类自动注入的元数据映射成正式标签，风险恰恰在于<strong>把元数据里的无界值（注解、自定义 label）全盘放行</strong>，使用时须配合 <code>labeldrop</code> 收窄。三个动作的语义边界要记牢：<code>labeldrop</code>/<code>labelkeep</code> 动的是<strong>标签名</strong>，<code>drop</code>/<code>keep</code> 动的是<strong>序列</strong>，<code>hashmod</code> 动的是<strong>归属</strong>。官方完整动作清单（含 <code>replace</code>、<code>lowercase</code>、<code>keepequal</code>、<code>dropequal</code> 等）见 <a href=\"https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/configuration/\">Prometheus configuration</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    M[metric_relabel_configs] --&gt; D1{action=labeldrop?}&#10;    D1 --&gt;|是| R1[删掉整个标签维度&lt;br/&gt;降基数]&#10;    D1 --&gt;|否| D2{action=drop/keep?}&#10;    D2 --&gt;|是| R2[丢弃/保留整条序列&lt;br/&gt;收窄范围]&#10;    D2 --&gt;|否| D3{action=hashmod?}&#10;    D3 --&gt;|是| R3[按 modulus 分片&lt;br/&gt;分散基数]&#10;    R1 --&gt; W[写入 TSDB]&#10;    R2 --&gt; W&#10;    R3 --&gt; W\">flowchart LR\n    M[metric_relabel_configs] --&gt; D1{action=labeldrop?}\n    D1 --&gt;|是| R1[删掉整个标签维度&lt;br/&gt;降基数]\n    D1 --&gt;|否| D2{action=drop/keep?}\n    D2 --&gt;|是| R2[丢弃/保留整条序列&lt;br/&gt;收窄范围]\n    D2 --&gt;|否| D3{action=hashmod?}\n    D3 --&gt;|是| R3[按 modulus 分片&lt;br/&gt;分散基数]\n    R1 --&gt; W[写入 TSDB]\n    R2 --&gt; W\n    R3 --&gt; W</pre><h2 id=\"series-limit-从抓取级到租户级的多层限额\">series limit：从抓取级到租户级的多层限额</h2><p><code>relabel</code> 是&quot;改&quot;，<code>series limit</code> 是&quot;拦&quot;。它出现在多个层级，<strong>语义与失败行为各不相同</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>抓取级限额</strong>写在 <code>scrape_config</code> 里，作用于单个 target 的一次抓取，超限会<strong>丢弃整个抓取结果</strong>并给 target 打上 <code>scrape_samples_limit_exceeded</code> / <code>scrape_series_limit_exceeded</code> 之类的健康状态。常用字段包括 <code>sample_limit</code>（单次抓取样本数上限）、<code>label_limit</code>（每个样本标签数上限）、<code>label_name_length_limit</code> 与 <code>label_value_length_limit</code>（标签名/值长度上限）、<code>body_size_limit</code>（响应体上限）以及 <code>target_limit</code>（target 数上限）。这类限额的价值在于<strong>把爆炸限制在单个 target 内</strong>——一个疯掉的 exporter 不会污染整个 TSDB。</p>\n<p><strong>引擎级/租户级限额</strong>不在开源 Prometheus 单机里，而在长存储与多租户方案中。Grafana Mimir 用 <code>max_global_series_per_user</code>（单租户全局序列上限）和 <code>max_global_series_per_metric</code>（单租户单指标序列上限）做硬封顶，见 <a href=\"https://grafana.com/docs/mimir/latest/configure/configure-limits/\">Mimir limits 配置</a>。VictoriaMetrics 用 <code>-maxLabelsPerTimeseries</code> 限制单序列标签数，并提供 <code>-maxSeriesPerMetric</code> 等旋钮。这类限额的失败行为是<strong>按请求拒绝</strong>——写入返回 4xx/5xx，并在 <code>cortex_discarded_samples_total</code>（Mimir）或被拒样本计数里体现。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>限额</th>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>单位</th>\n<th>超限行为</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>sample_limit</code></td>\n<td>scrape_config</td>\n<td>样本/次抓取</td>\n<td>丢弃整次抓取</td>\n<td>依 target 而定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>label_limit</code></td>\n<td>scrape_config</td>\n<td>标签数/样本</td>\n<td>丢弃该样本</td>\n<td>30 左右</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>label_value_length_limit</code></td>\n<td>scrape_config</td>\n<td>字节</td>\n<td>丢弃该样本</td>\n<td>2048</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>target_limit</code></td>\n<td>scrape_config</td>\n<td>target 数</td>\n<td>拒绝新增 target</td>\n<td>依规模而定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_global_series_per_user</code></td>\n<td>Mimir 租户</td>\n<td>序列数</td>\n<td>拒绝写入</td>\n<td>按配额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>max_global_series_per_metric</code></td>\n<td>Mimir 租户</td>\n<td>序列数/指标</td>\n<td>拒绝写入</td>\n<td>按配额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-maxLabelsPerTimeseries</code></td>\n<td>VictoriaMetrics</td>\n<td>标签数/序列</td>\n<td>拒绝写入</td>\n<td>依配置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>限额值不是越大越好。设得过松等于没有防护，设得过紧会在业务扩容时<strong>把正常指标一起拒掉</strong>——一个&quot;促销日流量翻三倍、<code>pod</code> 数随之翻三倍&quot;的场景，若 <code>max_global_series_per_user</code> 恰好卡在临界点，被拒的可能是你最需要的 SLO 指标。合理做法是<strong>按指标分级配额</strong>：对 <code>http_requests_total</code> 这类核心指标给宽松上限，对 <code>cart_items_viewed</code> 这类边缘埋点给严格上限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规模化运维-把限额接进告警与变更闭环\">规模化运维：把限额接进告警与变更闭环</h2><p>配套的运维动作要形成闭环。<strong>变更侧</strong>：任何新增标签、新增采集 job 都要走&quot;基数预估&quot;——用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∏</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\prod |V_i|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 粗算上界，预估超过当前 head 序列数 1% 的改动需要评审。<strong>响应侧</strong>：当 <code>head_series</code> 逼近集群容量时，先按 <a href=\"cardinality-source-measurement\">高基数来源与度量</a> 里的方法定位 top-N 指标（<code>topk(10, count by (__name__)({__name__=~&quot;.+&quot;}))</code>），再决定是 relabel 删除、应用改造还是分区迁移。<strong>兜底侧</strong>：把 <code>--storage.tsdb.retention.time</code>（默认 15 天）与容量规划绑定——保留期越长，历史块越多，磁盘压力随基数线性放大。</p>\n<p>真正的规模化能力不在单个限额数字上，而在<strong>发现-定位-收敛</strong>这条链路是否短。把抓取级限额当成&quot;最后一道闸&quot;而非&quot;第一道防线&quot;，把 relabel 做成可热重载的配置（<code>POST /-/reload</code> 或 <code>SIGHUP</code>）而非重启，才能让基数治理从&quot;季度大扫除&quot;变成&quot;随发布持续收敛&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>基数上界</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\prod_{i=1}^{n} |V_i|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.104em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 只是理论上界，真正致命的是随规模线性增长的<strong>无界标签</strong>（<code>user_id</code>、<code>order_id</code>、<code>pod</code> UID）。</li>\n<li><strong>标签设计是治本层</strong>：判据是&quot;取值可枚举 + 有聚合意义&quot;，无界标识应下沉到日志或 exemplar，而非变成标签。</li>\n<li><strong>relabel 是治标层</strong>：<code>labeldrop</code> 删维度降基数、<code>drop</code>/<code>keep</code> 收窄序列范围、<code>hashmod</code> 水平分散基数，三者语义不可混用。</li>\n<li><strong>series limit 是兜底层</strong>：抓取级（<code>sample_limit</code>、<code>label_limit</code>）把爆炸限制在单 target，租户级（Mimir <code>max_global_series_per_user</code>）防跨租户拖垮，二者失败行为不同。</li>\n<li><strong>限额必须可观测</strong>：以 <code>prometheus_tsdb_head_series_created_total</code> 的 churn 速率驱动告警，比序列绝对数更早发现标签漂移。</li>\n<li>治理的成本按层递减：应用改造最贵但一劳永逸，relabel 热重载即可，series limit 只在事故后兜底。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Root[高基数治理] --&gt; Design[标签设计: 可枚举判据]&#10;    Root --&gt; Relabel[relabel: labeldrop/drop/hashmod]&#10;    Root --&gt; Limit[series limit: scrape 级 + 租户级]&#10;    Root --&gt; Ops[运维闭环: churn 告警 + top-N 定位]\">graph TD\n    Root[高基数治理] --&gt; Design[标签设计: 可枚举判据]\n    Root --&gt; Relabel[relabel: labeldrop/drop/hashmod]\n    Root --&gt; Limit[series limit: scrape 级 + 租户级]\n    Root --&gt; Ops[运维闭环: churn 告警 + top-N 定位]</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"治理手段：标签设计、relabel drop 与 series limit","id":"治理手段-标签设计-relabel-drop-与-series-limit"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"标签设计：把维度放进名字还是放进标签","id":"标签设计-把维度放进名字还是放进标签"},{"level":2,"text":"relabel：抓取路径上的 drop/keep/hashmod","id":"relabel-抓取路径上的-drop-keep-hashmod"},{"level":2,"text":"series limit：从抓取级到租户级的多层限额","id":"series-limit-从抓取级到租户级的多层限额"},{"level":2,"text":"规模化运维：把限额接进告警与变更闭环","id":"规模化运维-把限额接进告警与变更闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高基数根因与度量：series 爆炸来源与 TSDB status 分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/timeseries-database-prometheus-tsdb-storage-engine/cardinality-operate-scale/cardinality-source-measurement"},"next":{"title":"规模化运维：分片联邦、HA 双写与长期存储成本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/timeseries-database-prometheus-tsdb-storage-engine/cardinality-operate-scale/sharding-federation-longterm-storage"}}